{"id":296,"slug":"296-race-condition-trong-async-javascript-la-gi-va-cach-xu-ly","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Promise & Async","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Race condition trong async JavaScript là gì và cách xử lý?","question_en":"What is a race condition in async JavaScript and how do you handle it?","answer_vi":"Race condition xảy ra khi nhiều tác vụ bất đồng bộ chạy chồng nhau và **kết quả phụ thuộc vào cái nào về trước** — thứ tự đó không được đảm bảo.\n\nTrường hợp thường gặp: ô tìm kiếm gõ nhanh, phản hồi cũ về sau phản hồi mới và **ghi đè kết quả đúng**.\n\n```javascript\n// SAI\nasync function onType(q) {\n  const res = await fetch(`/search?q=${q}`)\n  setResults(await res.json())     // request cũ về muộn sẽ ghi đè\n}\n```\n\nBa cách xử lý, theo thứ tự nên dùng:\n\n**1. Huỷ request cũ — sạch nhất, còn tiết kiệm băng thông:**\n\n```javascript\nlet controller\nasync function onType(q) {\n  controller?.abort()\n  controller = new AbortController()\n  try {\n    const res = await fetch(`/search?q=${q}`, { signal: controller.signal })\n    setResults(await res.json())\n  } catch (e) {\n    if (e.name !== 'AbortError') throw e\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**2. Đánh số request, bỏ kết quả không phải mới nhất:**\n\n```javascript\nlet latest = 0\nasync function onType(q) {\n  const id = ++latest\n  const data = await search(q)\n  if (id !== latest) return        // đã có request mới hơn, bỏ kết quả này\n  setResults(data)\n}\n```\n\n**3. Debounce** — giảm số request từ đầu, thường dùng kèm cách 1.\n\n**Trong React:** cách chuẩn là dọn dẹp trong `useEffect`:\n\n```javascript\nuseEffect(() => {\n  let cancelled = false\n  search(q).then((d) => { if (!cancelled) setResults(d) })\n  return () => { cancelled = true }\n}, [q])\n```","answer_en":"A race condition occurs when several asynchronous operations overlap and **the outcome depends on which finishes first** — an order nothing guarantees.\n\nThe classic case: a search box where a stale response arrives after a newer one and **overwrites the correct result**.\n\n```javascript\n// WRONG\nasync function onType(q) {\n  const res = await fetch(`/search?q=${q}`)\n  setResults(await res.json())     // a late old request overwrites the new one\n}\n```\n\nThree remedies, in the order to reach for them:\n\n**1. Cancel the old request — cleanest, and it saves bandwidth:**\n\n```javascript\nlet controller\nasync function onType(q) {\n  controller?.abort()\n  controller = new AbortController()\n  try {\n    const res = await fetch(`/search?q=${q}`, { signal: controller.signal })\n    setResults(await res.json())\n  } catch (e) {\n    if (e.name !== 'AbortError') throw e\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**2. Number the requests and discard anything but the latest:**\n\n```javascript\nlet latest = 0\nasync function onType(q) {\n  const id = ++latest\n  const data = await search(q)\n  if (id !== latest) return        // a newer request exists, drop this result\n  setResults(data)\n}\n```\n\n**3. Debounce** — fewer requests to begin with, usually paired with option 1.\n\n**In React:** the idiomatic form is cleanup inside `useEffect`:\n\n```javascript\nuseEffect(() => {\n  let cancelled = false\n  search(q).then((d) => { if (!cancelled) setResults(d) })\n  return () => { cancelled = true }\n}, [q])\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Race condition xảy ra khi nhiều tác vụ bất đồng bộ chạy chồng nhau và <strong>kết quả phụ thuộc vào cái nào về trước</strong> — thứ tự đó không được đảm bảo.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Trường hợp thường gặp: ô tìm kiếm gõ nhanh, phản hồi cũ về sau phản hồi mới và <strong>ghi đè kết quả đúng</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// SAI\nasync function onType(q) {\n  const res = await fetch(`/search?q=${q}`)\n  setResults(await res.json())     // request cũ về muộn sẽ ghi đè\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// SAI</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">onType</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">q</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> res = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fetch</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`/search?q=<span class=\"hljs-subst\">${q}</span>`</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setResults</span>(<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> res.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>())     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// request cũ về muộn sẽ ghi đè</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Ba cách xử lý, theo thứ tự nên dùng:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>1. Huỷ request cũ — sạch nhất, còn tiết kiệm băng thông:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"let controller\nasync function onType(q) {\n  controller?.abort()\n  controller = new AbortController()\n  try {\n    const res = await fetch(`/search?q=${q}`, { signal: controller.signal })\n    setResults(await res.json())\n  } catch (e) {\n    if (e.name !== 'AbortError') throw e\n  }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> controller\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">onType</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">q</span>) {\n  controller?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">abort</span>()\n  controller = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AbortController</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> res = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fetch</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`/search?q=<span class=\"hljs-subst\">${q}</span>`</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">signal</span>: controller.<span class=\"hljs-property\">signal</span> })\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setResults</span>(<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> res.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>())\n  } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (e) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (e.<span class=\"hljs-property\">name</span> !== <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;AbortError&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> e\n  }\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">**2.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Đánh số request, bỏ kết quả không phải mới nhất:**</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"let latest = 0\nasync function onType(q) {\n  const id = ++latest\n  const data = await search(q)\n  if (id !== latest) return        // đã có request mới hơn, bỏ kết quả này\n  setResults(data)\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> latest = <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">onType</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">q</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> id = ++latest\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> data = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">search</span>(q)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (id !== latest) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// đã có request mới hơn, bỏ kết quả này</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setResults</span>(data)\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>3. Debounce</strong> — giảm số request từ đầu, thường dùng kèm cách 1.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Trong React:</strong> cách chuẩn là dọn dẹp trong <code>useEffect</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"useEffect(() =&gt; {\n  let cancelled = false\n  search(q).then((d) =&gt; { if (!cancelled) setResults(d) })\n  return () =&gt; { cancelled = true }\n}, [q])\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useEffect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> cancelled = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">search</span>(q).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">then</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">d</span>) =&gt;</span> { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!cancelled) <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setResults</span>(d) })\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> { cancelled = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span> }\n}, [q])</code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">A race condition occurs when several asynchronous operations overlap and <strong>the outcome depends on which finishes first</strong> — an order nothing guarantees.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">The classic case: a search box where a stale response arrives after a newer one and <strong>overwrites the correct result</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// WRONG\nasync function onType(q) {\n  const res = await fetch(`/search?q=${q}`)\n  setResults(await res.json())     // a late old request overwrites the new one\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// WRONG</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">onType</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">q</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> res = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fetch</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`/search?q=<span class=\"hljs-subst\">${q}</span>`</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setResults</span>(<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> res.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>())     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// a late old request overwrites the new one</span>\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Three remedies, in the order to reach for them:</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>1. Cancel the old request — cleanest, and it saves bandwidth:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"let controller\nasync function onType(q) {\n  controller?.abort()\n  controller = new AbortController()\n  try {\n    const res = await fetch(`/search?q=${q}`, { signal: controller.signal })\n    setResults(await res.json())\n  } catch (e) {\n    if (e.name !== 'AbortError') throw e\n  }\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> controller\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">onType</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">q</span>) {\n  controller?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">abort</span>()\n  controller = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AbortController</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> res = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fetch</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">`/search?q=<span class=\"hljs-subst\">${q}</span>`</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">signal</span>: controller.<span class=\"hljs-property\">signal</span> })\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setResults</span>(<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> res.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>())\n  } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (e) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (e.<span class=\"hljs-property\">name</span> !== <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;AbortError&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> e\n  }\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">**2.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Number the requests and discard anything but the latest:**</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"let latest = 0\nasync function onType(q) {\n  const id = ++latest\n  const data = await search(q)\n  if (id !== latest) return        // a newer request exists, drop this result\n  setResults(data)\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> latest = <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">onType</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">q</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> id = ++latest\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> data = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">search</span>(q)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (id !== latest) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// a newer request exists, drop this result</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setResults</span>(data)\n}</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>3. Debounce</strong> — fewer requests to begin with, usually paired with option 1.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>In React:</strong> the idiomatic form is cleanup inside <code>useEffect</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"useEffect(() =&gt; {\n  let cancelled = false\n  search(q).then((d) =&gt; { if (!cancelled) setResults(d) })\n  return () =&gt; { cancelled = true }\n}, [q])\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useEffect</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> cancelled = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">search</span>(q).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">then</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">d</span>) =&gt;</span> { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!cancelled) <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setResults</span>(d) })\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> { cancelled = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span> }\n}, [q])</code></pre></div>","references":[{"label":"MDN — AbortController","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/AbortController"},{"label":"React — Fetching data in Effects","url":"https://react.dev/reference/react/useEffect#fetching-data-with-effects"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/201-su-khac-biet-giua-var-let-va-const-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa var, let và const là gì?"},{"url":"/q/202-javascript-co-nhung-kieu-du-lieu-nguyen-thuy-primitive-types-nao","title":"JavaScript có những kiểu dữ liệu nguyên thuỷ (primitive types) nào?"},{"url":"/q/205-symbol-trong-javascript-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Symbol trong JavaScript là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/207-toan-tu-va-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Toán tử == và === khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/208-type-coercion-ep-kieu-tu-dong-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Type coercion (ép kiểu tự động) trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/209-truthy-va-falsy-values-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Truthy và falsy values trong JavaScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/210-nan-la-gi-tai-sao-nan-nan","title":"NaN là gì? Tại sao NaN !== NaN?"},{"url":"/q/211-hoisting-trong-javascript-la-gi","title":"Hoisting trong JavaScript là gì?"}]}